  "answer_text": "Here is the information to help you log in to **PreLicenseTraining.com**:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd10 PreLicenseTraining.com Login\n\n**PreLicenseTraining.com** offers insurance pre-license training and continuing education courses online for insurance professionals.\n\nYou can access the login page directly using the links below:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd17 Login Links\n\n| Portal | URL |\n|---|---|\n| **Student Login** | [prelicensetraining.com/login](https://prelicensetraining.com/login) |\n| **Mentor / Recruiter Login** | [prelicensetraining.com/ca/mentor/register](https://prelicensetraining.com/ca/mentor/register) |\n| **New Student Registration** | [prelicensetraining.com/register](https://prelicensetraining.com/register) |\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcdd Tips:\n- If you already have an account, go to the **Student Login** page and enter your credentials.\n- If you're a **Mentor or Recruiter**, use the dedicated Mentor Portal link above.\n- If you're **new**, click the Registration link to create an account.\n\n> \u26a0\ufe0f If you're having trouble logging in (e.g., forgot password), look for a **\"Forgot Password\"** option on the login page, or contact PreLicenseTraining.com support directly through their website.",
